     A            NCPNM2    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A                                      COLHDG('Payee Name #2)')
     A            NCCLCD    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('Catastrophe Loss' +
     A                                      'Code')
